{
  "$comment": "EXP-1240 (EXP-1259 D12): THE Work card, ONE card x4 for a claude workflow, a task list (the run's `task_list` state) and a subagent (the items carrying one `subagentId`), replacing WorkflowCard, TaskListBlock and SubagentGroupRow on web (components/agent-session), desktop (crates/ui workflow_card.rs + the task list + subagent group rows), iOS and Android. Model = pure `workCard(input)` (TS reference packages/domain-contract/src/work-card.ts; mirrors desktop steer::work_card, iOS ExpCore WorkCard.swift, Android domain/WorkCard.kt), every mirror replays `cases` and compares the WHOLE expected object. Paint: a card at radius lg with the card hairline (no shadow). HEADER row `header` px: the kind icon (concept `icons`), the name (medium, truncates), the muted kind word, then trailing the progress and the elapsed time joined by ' · ' (muted, tabular figures), a 12px spinner in front of them while `running`. SEGMENT BAR under the header (workflow phases, tasks; never a subagent): `segments` equal-width capsules `segmentHeight` px high, `segmentGap` apart, the track = the muted fill, `fill` of each painted in the foreground (failed = rose, running segments fill the same foreground). ROWS `row` px each, divided by the hairline: `folded` = a check glyph, the joined phase titles, the muted lane count, trailing duration + a chevron (opens the folded phases' lanes in place); `phase` = a state glyph (running = the 12px spinner, done = check, failed = rose x, pending = the dashed circle), the title, the muted detail, trailing duration, then for running/failed phases its `lanes`, each a `lane` px line indented `laneIndent` px: a 6px dot (done = muted, running = green with the spinner trailing instead of a duration, error = rose, queued = hollow), the label, the muted model, trailing the duration; `task` = the state glyph + the label; `status` = one muted line. No report text, no token counts, no JSON anywhere on the card. A lane row (and a subagent card) opens that lane's transcript in the client's existing nested transcript view; a task row does nothing. The session-list caption keeps workflow-caption.json (a different surface). Mirrors compare `fill` within 1e-9.",
